# Portfolio environment variables
# Copy this file to ".env" and fill in real values. Never commit your real .env file.

# Optional: AI API key for a real generative chatbot backend.
# The portfolio works without this — the chatbot runs in demo mode using local data.
# To enable real AI answers, deploy a Supabase Edge Function and set this server-side.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=your-key-here
